{"version":1,"content":"<p>近日，英國維珍銀河新一代Delta級載人飛船Apeiron（阿派隆）完成首飛，<strong>這也是該公司接替VSS Unity的新一代主力亞軌道載人飛行器，標誌着商業太空旅遊項目邁入新階段</strong>。這款新飛船定位高頻次商業運營，設計壽命支持500次以上飛行任務，目標每周最多執行兩次太空飛行，大幅提升發射效率，可一次性搭載6名乘客，飛行流程延續維珍銀河經典模式。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/science/1587280.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T11:24:01.971274+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":177,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T11:11:40+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T11:17:17.071320+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T11:17:17.071320+00:00","content_hash":"0631fbab2797ca9728bccd9b3a5260d7a8fee441b78746c8c1faf6c007c07eb2","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}